('t2-short-02', 2, '2.4.4', 'AS', 'short', 5, 'In an economy, the marginal propensity to save is 0.15, the marginal propensity to pay tax is 0.25 and the marginal propensity to import is 0.35 (illustrative data). Calculate the value of the multiplier and the eventual change in real national income following an increase in government spending of £12 billion. Explain one reason why the actual increase in real national income may be smaller.', null, null),
